#
# Log message formatter with pattern-based formatting.
# Supports placeholders: {datetime}, {utcoffset}, {timestamp}, {level},
# {level5}, {level7}, {username}, {pid}, {thread}, {program}, {program16},
# {name}, {name40}, {message}.
